# the argument of ledger.md by rule (phil/skeleton): connectives from the parse, an atom to each clause
logic	s5
atom	balanc(x)	x: balances
atom	count_correctly(x)	x: counted correctly
atom	ledger_balanc	the ledger balances
atom	miscount_count_necessary(x)	x: could have miscounted his counting was necessary not fortunate
P1	S1	[](balanc(ledger) -> count_correctly(clerk))
P2	S2	ledger_balanc
C	S3	!miscount_count_necessary(clerk)
